{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor, v_3 : int} |= ndim(v_1) = 4 ∧ ndim(v_2) = 4 ∧ v_3 ≥ 1 ∧ v_3 × (shape(v_1, 2) - 1) + shape(v_2, 2) - 2 × v_3 > 0 ∧ v_3 × (shape(v_1, 3) - 1) + shape(v_2, 3) - 2 × v_3 > 0
